   {
    "team": "Nova Knicks",
    "line": "Cam Spencer dropped 24 points with three threes after Dylan Cardwell got cut, and that is the only reason this matchup is still alive."
   },
   {
    "team": "LeParth James",
    "line": "Anfernee Simons, Brice Sensabaugh and Svi Mykhailiuk combined for 7 points on 3-of-13 shooting, and that is the pickup package that supposedly improved this team."
   },
   {
    "team": "Adam Silver Dez Nuts",
    "line": "Shai Gilgeous-Alexander scored 38 on his bench, and this team is already winning 8-1, so nobody is ever going to ask why."
